### Server Actions & API Routes

#### [MODIFY] [assessments.ts](file:///c:/Semester/version%20Skripsi/v1/src/actions/assessments.ts)
- Update `getAssessmentWithQuestions` to include `imageUrl: questions.imageUrl` in the returned fields so students can view question images.
